1
00:00:01,195 --> 00:00:03,151
As Uke strikes the side of your head

2
00:00:03,152 --> 00:00:04,373
raise both arms

3
00:00:04,374 --> 00:00:06,991
lead the strike around in a big circular movement,

4
00:00:07,492 --> 00:00:10,647
as you cut down control his elbow

5
00:00:10,948 --> 00:00:12,275
step in deeply

6
00:00:12,276 --> 00:00:14,780
with the other arm controlling his neck and shoulder

7
00:00:14,781 --> 00:00:16,567
turn and cut down deeply

8
00:00:16,968 --> 00:00:19,225
As Uke gets up to regain his balance,

9
00:00:19,226 --> 00:00:20,547
draw him in to your shoulder

10
00:00:20,948 --> 00:00:22,035
turn your body

11
00:00:22,036 --> 00:00:25,303
step forward deeply and
throw down in front of you.

